   "text": "Bologna Business School (University of Bologna) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nBologna Business School (University of Bologna)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nBBS is an international business school, created by the University of Bologna, the oldest university in the world, to shape a new generation of business leaders, capable of driving international growth and digital transformation, with a view to sustainability. Our academic interdisciplinary and strongly practice-oriented approach offers a unique learning experience in collaboration with Italian “industry champions” especially from the automotive, food and wine, sustainability, automation& robotics and luxury fields. Our home is in Bologna at Villa Guastavillani, a splendid 16th century residence located in the heart of Italy, in one of the most leading economic regions of Italy and Europe.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 06:36\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n10/04/2026 07:07\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nItaly\nYearly Fees\nMax: €35,000.00\nMin: €13,800.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n50%\n6,350 of 12,700 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2000\nCampus(es)\nBologana\nCountry\nItaly\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n05/02/2024\nContract End Date\n30/06/2025\nOverride Till Contract End Date\n31/08/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nExpired\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nGlobal MBA: Full and Partial merit-based scholarships. The scholarships will be awarded on the basis of merit criteria to the students occupying the highest positions in the selection process.\nProfessional Masters: Partial merit-based scholarships. The scholarships will be awarded on the basis of merit criteria to the students occupying the highest positions in the selection process.\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8fOflINjIdA\n https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HLYI8YEUHHA\n https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sUmOLGy1h0o\n https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HLYI8YEUHHA\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nApplication fee: EURO 60 (University Degree programs)\nExecutive Certificate programmes: Free of Charge.",
